# Claude personal/machine-local memory (template .example is committed)
CLAUDE.local.md

# Personal financial data - NEVER commit this
data/

# Broker statements dropped for import (investments module) - personal data
imports/*
!imports/README.md

# Secrets (Gemini key, broker API keys) - NEVER commit; ship .env.example instead
.env

